    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Weight down 1 kg in two weeks; no fever or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Right-sided throat pain and painful swallowing; no ear pain or voice change</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, hemoptysis, or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea when varenicline is taken after meals; no vomiting</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Worried about the diagnosis and the time it may take from his writing; no low mood; sleep and dreams unchanged</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

